22
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:47.140
I'm wearing them today.
我今天就穿着它。

23
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.080
I wanted to show you.
我想让你看看。

24
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:48.179
Stand up.
站起来。

25
00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:48.300
Let me see.
让我看看。

26
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.660
She got the crotch right.
她把裆部改好了。

27
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.440
She got the crotch right.
她把裆部改好了。

28
