38
00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:22.500
Pam is working at corporate in New York City to help pay for her life at art school.
帕姆在纽约的企业总部工作，以支付她在艺术学校的生活费。

39
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.500
Holly and Michael take their relationship to the next level, resulting in a burglary at the office.
霍莉和迈克尔的关系更进一步，导致办公室遭遇了入室盗窃。

40
00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:38.140
Michael hosts an auction to recoup the valuables lost, and Dwight turns to Phyllis for advice on how to win Angela back.
迈克尔举办了一场拍卖会来弥补丢失的财物，而德怀特向菲利斯寻求如何追回安吉拉的建议。

41
00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:41.840
