50
00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.200
New writer alert.
新编剧预警。

51
00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:55.160
New writer alert.
新编剧预警。

52
00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.300
Charlie Grandy.
查理·格兰迪。

53
00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.860
Ding, ding, ding, ding, ding.
叮，叮，叮，叮，叮。

54
00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.120
