她说这话绝对没错。

106
00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:40.920
She did not sleep and her adrenaline did kick in.
她确实没睡，肾上腺素也确实发挥了作用。

107
00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:41.760
So she was good.
所以她状态很好。

108
00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.540
I bet.
我敢肯定。

109
00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.200
I can't sleep like before a big day ever.
我每次在大日子前都睡不着。

110
00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.040
I'm like up all through the night.
我整晚都醒着。

111
00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:47.780
I know.
我知道。

112
00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:53.220
That happens to me as an actor the night before my first day on a new project, especially.
作为演员，我在新项目开拍的前一晚也会这样，尤其是第一天。

113
00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.680
I'm so nervous.
我太紧张了。

114
00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.560
The day before a big trip, I'm always like, okay, did I pack my charger?
大旅行的前一天，我总是会想，好吧，充电器带了吗？

115
00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.120
Got it.
带了。

116
00:04:59.540 --> 00:04:59.820
Underwear?
内衣呢？

117
00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:00.420
I don't know.
我不知道。

118
00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.240
Did I pack underwear?
我带内衣了吗？

119
00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:01.680
I don't know.
我不知道。

120
00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:02.120
I don't know.
我不知道。

121
00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.120
Oh my God, I got to get up.
天哪，我得起床了。

122
00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:03.660
I got to go look.
我得去看看。

123
00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.440
I can't sleep the night before anything big.
任何大事的前一晚我都睡不着。

124
00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.740
All right, are you ready for fast fact number three?
好了，准备好迎接第三个快问快答了吗？

125
00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.140
Roy is back.
罗伊回来了。

126
00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.060
Oh, yes, he is.
噢，没错，他回来了。

127
00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.780
He comes back in this episode and it's a huge surprise.
他在这集里回归了，这真是个巨大的惊喜。

128
00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.320
It's so well done.
处理得太棒了。

129
00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.740
The writers said they were always looking for ways to bring David back.
编剧们说他们一直在寻找让大卫回归的方法。

130
00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.060
Well, I hadn't seen this episode in a long time.
嗯，我很久没看这一集了。

131
00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.720
And when I watched it and he walked in, I was like, oh my God, Roy's here.
当我重看这一集，看到他走进来时，我心想，天哪，罗伊来了。

132
00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:31.880
And now he's with Jim.
而且他现在和吉姆在一起。

133
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:32.700
Oh, no, no, no.
噢，不，不，不。

134
00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.540
Like I completely forgot.
我完全忘了。

135
