Remember, we never did a show Bible goodbye for him.
记得吗，我们从来没为他做过正式的告别。

137
00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:46.060
So I thought maybe let's remember Roy since we're going to see him this week.
所以我想，既然这周我们要见到他，不如回顾一下罗伊。

138
00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:46.960
Let's do it.
来吧。

139
00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:51.140
Roy Anderson worked in the warehouse at Dunder Mifflin.
罗伊·安德森曾在邓德·米夫林的仓库工作。

140
00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.780
He was engaged to Pam for three years.
他和帕姆订婚了三年。

141
00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.840
They went to high school together.
他们是高中同学。

142
00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.860
He was on the football team and he hoped they would go to Mexico for their honeymoon.
他是橄榄球队队员，他曾希望去墨西哥度蜜月。

143
00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:06.080
He has wave runners that he bought with his brother, which they eventually sold at a loss.
他和兄弟合买过水上摩托，后来亏本卖掉了。

144
00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.620
He has a truck.
他有一辆卡车。

145
00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.840
He would carpool to work with Pam.
他以前会和帕姆拼车上班。

146
00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.160
He thinks Angelo's kind of hot.
他觉得安吉拉挺辣的。

147
00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:19.040
He plays fantasy football and he is eventually fired after he tries to attack Jim.
他玩梦幻橄榄球，后来因为试图袭击吉姆而被解雇了。

148
00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:25.400
