Max comes out of his office and says, hey, Bruce Springsteen is going to be calling me.
马克斯从办公室出来说，嘿，布鲁斯·斯普林斯汀待会儿会给我打电话。

822
00:36:10.770 --> 00:36:11.870
I'm going to be down in the studio.
我要去演播室那边。

823
00:36:12.030 --> 00:36:14.030
I'm going to need you to forward his call to me.
我需要你帮我把他的电话转接给我。

824
00:36:14.150 --> 00:36:14.790
